join detective right
detective: I checked Dracula’s cloak. The key was in the wrong spot.
join gardener left
gardener: Huh.
gardener: He’d never put it in the wrong pocket…
gardener (antsy): …but someone else might.
gardener: Not sure why anyone would do that, though.
detective_thinking: Maybe someone took the key from Dracula and returned it to the wrong pocket.
detective_thinking: And maybe they used the key sometime in between.

